": ["2117205902105469240"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 81, "id": "20169416", "start": 68, "username": "tracyalloway"}], "urls": [{"description": "Podcast Episode · Odd Lots · November 2 · 52m", "display_url": "podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/the…", "end": 275, "expanded_url": "https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/the-%24300-billion-structured-notes-market-is-booming/id1056200096?i=1000799371410", "images": [{"height": 1200, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117205904949231616/EhTasfg8?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117205904949231616/EhTasfg8?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 252, "status": 200, "title": "The $300 Billion Structured Notes Market Is Booming", "unwound_url": "https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/the-%24300-billion-structured-notes-market-is-booming/id1056200096?i=1000799371410", "url": "https://t.co/HpUGb6akbe"}]}, "id": "2117205902105469240", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 29, "impression_count": 28972, "like_count": 66, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "NEW ODD LOTS:\n\nThe $300 Billion Structured Notes Market Is Booming\n\n@tracyalloway and I talk to Alex Micalizzi, international head of equity structured notes at Nomura, about the increasing demand among rich clients for exotic ways to play this market https://t.co/HpUGb6akbe", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2117205902105469240"}, {"author_id": "733647469305864195", "created_at": "2026-11-02T08:36:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117174081728782545"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/GCxAYenVMY", "end": 95, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Brad_Setser/status/2117174081728782545/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117173987197292544", "start": 72, "url": "https://t.co/GCxAYenVMY"}, {"display_url": "x.com/michaelxpettis…", "end": 119, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/michaelxpettis/status/2117148674241278328", "start": 96, "url": "https://t.co/KXl12Mrrkh"}]}, "id": "2117174081728782545", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 36, "impression_count": 34668, "like_count": 179, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 18, "retweet_count": 41}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117148674241278328", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Enormous exports from China into Europe now -- chemical trade by weight https://t.co/GCxAYenVMY https://t.co/KXl12Mrrkh", "url": "https://x.com/Brad_Setser/status/2117174081728782545"}, {"author_id": "917683048782503937", "created_at": "2026-11-02T06:55:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117148674241278328"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 280, "id": "18949452", "start": 277, "username": "FT"}], "urls": [{"description": "Output has almost doubled in some key ingredients in five years, putting pressure on foreign rivals", "display_url": "ft.com/content/2962ad…", "end": 272, "expanded_url": "https://www.ft.com/content/2962ad57-cee1-4a63-82ba-17acfc09d812", "images": [{"height": 394, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117148676476882944/aXEM6Qgf?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 700}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117148676476882944/aXEM6Qgf?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 249, "status": 200, "title": "China’s soaring chemical exports threaten new trade war front", "unwound_url": "https://www.ft.com/content/2962ad57-cee1-4a63-82ba-17acfc09d812", "url": "https://t.co/86fx0whEgi"}]}, "id": "2117148674241278328", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 62, "impression_count": 45675, "like_count": 242, "quote_count": 10, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 67}, "text": "FT: \"China has nearly doubled its chemicals capacity in some areas in just five years and now accounts for about half of global output of certain products, putting pressure on foreign rivals and threatening to open up a new front in its trade war.\"\nhttps://t.co/86fx0whEgi via @ft", "url": "https://x.com/michaelxpettis/status/2117148674241278328"}, {"author_id": "917683048782503937", "created_at": "2026-11-02T06:47:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117146625952899203"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 277, "id": "23922797", "start": 268, "username": "SCMPNews"}], "urls": [{"description": "The move came after the offshore yuan broke through the psychologically important 6.65 level on Friday.", "display_url": "sc.mp/378oz?utm_sour…", "end": 263, "expanded_url": "https://sc.mp/378oz?utm_source=twitter&utm_campaign=3372944&utm_medium=share_widget", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117137717943488513/nrRYKp_B?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117137717943488513/nrRYKp_B?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 240, "title": "China signals caution over currency surge with weaker yuan fixing", "unwound_url": "https://www.scmp.com/economy/policy/article/3372944/yuan-fixing-trimmed-despite-four-year-high-offshore-beijing-manages-pace-appreciation?utm_source=twitter&utm_campaign=3372944&utm_medium=share_widget", "url": "https://t.co/QAZVHx9eXH"}]}, "id": "2117146625952899203", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 10964, "like_count": 47, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "SCMP: \"China’s central bank has set a weaker daily fixing for the yuan despite the offshore currency’s rise to a more than four-year high, signalling Beijing’s caution over the pace of appreciation amid external calls for a stronger yuan.\"\nhttps://t.co/QAZVHx9eXH via @scmpnews", "url": "https://x.com/michaelxpettis/status/2117146625952899203"}, {"author_id": "917683048782503937", "created_at": "2026-11-02T06:46:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117146201518698923"], "id": "2117146201518698923", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 11, "impression_count": 10291, "like_count": 101, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 19}, "text": "Caixin: \"Chinese automakers saw total profits tumble 68% year-on-year to 14.2 billion yuan ($2.1 billion) in September as rising costs and sluggish demand eat into margins. The deteriorating financial performance underscores the brutal reality of the world’s largest auto market,", "url": "https://x.com/michaelxpettis/status/2117146201518698923"}, {"author_id": "917683048782503937", "created_at": "2026-11-02T06:44:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117145920961716337"], "id": "2117145920961716337", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 23, "impression_count": 10552, "like_count": 68, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 18}, "text": "Caixin: \"China has issued an 18-point plan to cushion workers from artificial intelligence-driven displacement, directing officials to assess job risks before approving high-impact AI projects and urging companies to give employees advance notice and transition support. The", "url": "https://x.com/michaelxpettis/status/2117145920961716337"}, {"author_id": "917683048782503937", "created_at": "2026-11-02T05:07:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117121366730187116"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/YashengHuang/s…", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/YashengHuang/status/2116933156628488491", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/R6VYIn0S2T"}]}, "id": "2117121366730187116", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 55, "impression_count": 15005, "like_count": 95, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 18}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116933156628488491", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Yasheng Huang: \"Did Pudong model produce GDP growth? Yes, it did but it set a precedent for a developmental model based on extractive transfers from the disenfranchised rural Chinese to the relatively enfranchised urban Chinese. It shifted income shares from households to the https://t.co/R6VYIn0S2T", "url": "https://x.com/michaelxpettis/status/2117121366730187116"}, {"author_id": "3311286493", "created_at": "2026-11-02T00:53:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117057534502